  "page": "https://permitgu.vercel.app",
  "text": "# Other Government of Guam services\n\nTopic id: `services`. Official sites for common tasks that are not permit routes.\n\n- Renew a driver's license or ID: Guam online renewal and appointments. Official site: https://myid.guam.gov/ (keywords: driver license id renew real dmv car)\n- Pay a government bill: PayGuam online payments. Official site: https://pay.guam.gov/ (keywords: pay bill fee payment government)\n- Typhoon and emergency updates: Homeland Security / Civil Defense. Official site: https://ghs.guam.gov/ (keywords: typhoon emergency disaster storm shelter alert civil defense)\n- Find work or labor help: Department of Labor. Official site: https://dol.guam.gov/ (keywords: job work labor employment hire)\n- Public schools: Guam Department of Education. Official site: https://gdoe.net/ (keywords: school education student enroll)\n- Power service and outages: Guam Power Authority. Official site: https://www.guampowerauthority.com/ (keywords: power electric bill outage)\n- Check a contractor's license: Contractors License Board. Official site: https://clb.guam.gov/contractors-listing/ (keywords: contractor license verify check)\n- Taxes: Department of Revenue and Taxation. Official site: https://www.guamtax.com/ (keywords: tax taxes return revenue)\n\n## Other homepage topics\n\n- Open or renew a business license: File Form BL-01 with Rev & Tax, which routes it to every agency that must clear it. Renewals can be done online. Sources: [How to apply](https://www.govguamdocs.com/revtax/docs/PROCEDURESANDREQUIREMENTSFORNEWBL.pdf); [Renew online](https://www.guamtax.com/efile/biz.html) (keywords: business license shop store company sell open small renew)\n- Land, zoning, and surveys: DLM's Division of Planning supports the Guam Land Use Commission and reviews permit clearances. Sources: [DLM Planning](https://dlm.guam.gov/division-of-planning/) (keywords: land survey zoning subdivision lot property variance check zoning)\n"
